@startuml
title Requirement to Verified Variant
start
:Receive natural-language requirement;
:Compile Requirement IR;
if (Ambiguity above threshold?) then (yes)
  :Generate minimum clarification questions;
  stop
else (no)
  :Map intent to Feature candidates;
endif
:Solve Feature constraints;
if (Configuration valid?) then (yes)
  :Synthesize Architecture Graph;
  :Calculate delta and impact closure;
  :Generate bounded patch and tests;
  :Run build, test, security and policy gates;
  if (All mandatory gates pass?) then (yes)
    :Publish variant and evidence bundle;
  else (no)
    :Return bounded repair task;
  endif
else (no)
  :Return unsat core and alternatives;
endif
stop
@enduml

